#: ../../source/domhandler_readme.md:3
msgid ""
"The DOM handler creates a tree containing all nodes of a page. The tree "
"can be manipulated using the [domutils](https://github.com/fb55/domutils)"
" or [cheerio](https://github.com/cheeriojs/cheerio) libraries and "
"rendered using [dom-serializer](https://github.com/cheeriojs/dom-"
"serializer) ."
msgstr ""

