#: ../../source/domhandler_readme.md:65
msgid "Option: `withStartIndices`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/domhandler_readme.md:67
msgid ""
"Add a `startIndex` property to nodes. When the parser is used in a non-"
"streaming fashion, `startIndex` is an integer indicating the position of "
"the start of the node in the document. The default value is `false`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/domhandler_readme.md:72
msgid "Option: `withEndIndices`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/domhandler_readme.md:74
msgid ""
"Add an `endIndex` property to nodes. When the parser is used in a non-"
"streaming fashion, `endIndex` is an integer indicating the position of "
"the end of the node in the document. The default value is `false`."
msgstr ""

